  {
   "id": "order book dynamic model",
   "nombre_canonico": "order book dynamics model",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "order book dynamics model"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Modelo estocástico continuo del libro de órdenes que balancea facilidad de estimación, realismo empírico y tratabilidad analítica, modelando eventos de mercado como procesos de Poisson independientes.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "We propose a continuous-time stochastic model for the dynamics of a limit order book. The model strikes a balance between three desirable features: it can be estimated easily from data, it captures key empirical properties of order book dynamics and its analytical tractability allows for fast computation",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "limit order book",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "MEJORA_A",
     "tipo_original": "MEJORA_A",
     "objeto_texto": "equilibrium models of limit order books",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PREDICE",
     "tipo_original": "PREDICE",
     "objeto_texto": "direction of price moves",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "power law order arrival rate",
   "nombre_canonico": "power law order arrival rate",
   "tipo": "concepto",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "power law order arrival rate"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Especificación empírica de la tasa de llegada de órdenes límite λ(i)=k/i^α en función de la distancia i al mejor bid/ask, ajustada por mínimos cuadrados.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Empirical studies (Zovko and Farmer (2002) or Bouchaud et al. (2002)) suggest a power law, λ(i) = k iα, as a plausible speciﬁcation.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "order book dynamics model",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "MIDE",
     "tipo_original": "MIDE",
     "objeto_texto": "queue position",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cancellation rate",
   "nombre_canonico": "cancellation rate",
   "tipo": "concepto",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "cancellation rate"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Tasa de cancelación de órdenes límite proporcional al número de órdenes pendientes en un nivel de precio dado, con parámetro θ(i) que decrece con la distancia al bid/ask.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Cancellations of limit orders at a distance of i ticks from the opposite best quote occur at a rate proportional to the number of outstanding orders: if the number of outstanding orders at that level is x then the cancellation rate is θ(i)x.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "PARTE_DE",
     "tipo_original": "PARTE_DE",
     "objeto_texto": "order book dynamics model",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "birth death process",
   "nombre_canonico": "birth-death process",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "birth-death process"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Proceso estocástico usado para modelar la evolución de la cola en el bid o ask (número de órdenes) con tasas de nacimiento y muerte constantes/dependientes del estado, base para el cálculo de tiempos de primer paso.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Consider now a birth-death process with constant birth rate λ and death rates µi in state i ≥1, and let σb denote the ﬁrst-passage time of this process to 0 given it begins in state b.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "order book dynamics model",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PARTE_DE",
     "tipo_original": "PARTE_DE",
     "objeto_texto": "Laplace transform inversion",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "laplace transform inversion",
   "nombre_canonico": "Laplace transform inversion",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Laplace transform inversion"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Técnica de la literatura de colas usada para calcular semi-analíticamente probabilidades condicionales de eventos del book (movimiento de precio, ejecución) sin recurrir a simulación de Monte Carlo.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Using simple matrix computations and Laplace transform methods, we are able to eﬃciently compute probabilities of various events, conditional on the state of the order book",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "MEJORA_A",
     "tipo_original": "MEJORA_A",
     "objeto_texto": "Monte Carlo simulation",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PREDICE",
     "tipo_original": "PREDICE",
     "objeto_texto": "direction of price moves",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "REQUIERE",
     "tipo_original": "REQUIERE",
     "objeto_texto": "birth-death process",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "direction of price move",
   "nombre_canonico": "direction of price moves",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "direction of price moves"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Probabilidad de que el próximo cambio en el mid-price sea un incremento, condicional a la configuración del book (cantidades en bid/ask y spread), calculable con el modelo.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "We now compute the probability that the mid-price increases at its next move.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "queue position",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PARTE_DE",
     "tipo_original": "PARTE_DE",
     "objeto_texto": "order book dynamics model",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "making the spread",
   "nombre_canonico": "making the spread",
   "tipo": "estrategia",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "making the spread"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Estrategia de arbitraje estadístico que consiste en colocar órdenes límite simultáneas en bid y ask y esperar a que ambas se ejecuten antes de que el mid-price se mueva, capturando el spread bid-ask.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "If the probability of executing both a buy and a sell limit order before the price moves is high, a statistical arbitrage strategy can be designed by submitting limit orders at the bid and the ask and wait for both orders to execute.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "bid-ask spread",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "Laplace transform inversion",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "APLICA_A",
     "tipo_original": "APLICA_A",
     "objeto_texto": "market making",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "steady state shape of the book",
   "nombre_canonico": "steady-state shape of the book",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "steady-state shape of the book"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Perfil promedio del número de órdenes en función de la distancia al bid/ask en régimen estacionario, que exhibe una 'joroba' (hump) característica observada empíricamente y reproducida por el modelo sin ajuste fino.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Figure 2 shows that the average proﬁle of the order book displays a hump (in this case, at two ticks from the bid/ask), as observed in empirical studies",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "MIDE",
     "tipo_original": "MIDE",
     "objeto_texto": "market impact",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "PARTE_DE",
     "tipo_original": "PARTE_DE",
     "objeto_texto": "order book dynamics model",
     "doc_id": 26,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "conditional probability of execution",
   "nombre_canonico": "conditional probability of execution",
   "tipo": "concepto",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "conditional probability of execution"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    26
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Probabilidad de que una orden límite colocada en el bid se ejecute antes de que la cotización ask se mueva, dado el estado inicial del book; base para decidir si conviene colocar límite o mercado.",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "the probability of executing a limit order at the bid before the ask quote moves",
     "doc_id": 26
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "Laplace transform inversion",
